Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Dimensional Analysis using Mathematica", "Title",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.937331178736211*^9, 3.9373311930802803`*^9}, {
   3.9373323545266037`*^9, 3.937332417528911*^9}, {3.937332451078611*^9, 
   3.9373324675258303`*^9}, {3.937332572324354*^9, 3.937332576340596*^9}, {
   3.937332636214216*^9, 3.937332640793364*^9}, {3.937332718737913*^9, 
   3.937332752854508*^9}, 3.937335702238432*^9, {3.937397735093335*^9, 
   3.937397737813583*^9}, {3.93739839314435*^9, 3.937398502785137*^9}, {
   3.937398543137621*^9, 3.9373985636143713`*^9}, {3.937398601299879*^9, 
   3.937398619854075*^9}, {3.937398656205524*^9, 3.9373987949257402`*^9}, {
   3.937398860288422*^9, 3.937398923989519*^9}, 3.93739896638653*^9, {
   3.937399001674695*^9, 3.937399059060523*^9}, {3.937399090990934*^9, 
   3.937399129894874*^9}, {3.93739926444095*^9, 3.937399273261023*^9}, {
   3.9373993086343203`*^9, 3.937399359778208*^9}, {3.937399390786347*^9, 
   3.937399392243456*^9}, {3.9373995690198507`*^9, 3.937399605482751*^9}, {
   3.9373996516218967`*^9, 3.9373996526905527`*^9}, {3.937399690696227*^9, 
   3.937399739385562*^9}, {3.93739982128758*^9, 3.937399864513754*^9}, {
   3.937402744539137*^9, 3.9374027532714767`*^9}, {3.937402791689353*^9, 
   3.9374028019153214`*^9}, {3.9374028375821466`*^9, 3.937402926885277*^9}, {
   3.937402960008481*^9, 3.937402975243226*^9}, {3.937403213542894*^9, 
   3.937403251709651*^9}, {3.9374032817745247`*^9, 3.937403370571632*^9}, 
   3.937403452265437*^9, {3.937405574327149*^9, 3.937405618328578*^9}, {
   3.937405774369673*^9, 3.937405779024707*^9}, 3.9374074587162237`*^9, {
   3.937409520869334*^9, 3.937409537934641*^9}, {3.937410771237114*^9, 
   3.937410779533587*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a7698cbc-0131-489e-bf5d-\
3b625104c222"],

Cell["\<\
Tim Colonials\[LineSeparator]California Institute of Technology
October, 2024

While Mathematica offers some routines to employ Buckingham-Pi theorem to do \
dimensional analysis, I didn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t like the way they worked, so \
I created my own.  \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9374107975759172`*^9, 3.9374108666426373`*^9}, {
   3.937410920695284*^9, 3.937410923185543*^9}, 
   3.9374112288799353`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"57644f09-dc44-40df-86dd-\
0742a9965d3e"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["The module BuckPi", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.937410887005247*^9, 
  3.937410904579936*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2327e868-d1b7-4d8c-8fbd-\
8d530fe1a399"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Dimensional analysis will take a list of variables, with associated defined \
(physical) dimensions of each quantity, and create possible non-dimensional \
functional relationships amongst the variables, by application of the \
Buckingham-Pi theorem.  The input list is of the form\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"sampleinput", " ", "=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox["c", "p"], ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Meters\>\"", "/", "\"\<Seconds\>\""}]}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\[Lambda]", ",", "\"\<Meters\>\""}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"g", ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Meters\>\"", "/", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Seconds\>\"", "^", "2"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"h", ",", "\"\<Meters\>\""}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\[Rho]", ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Kilograms\>\"", "/", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<Meters\>\"", "^", "3"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\[Sigma]", ",", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Newtons\>\"", "/", "\"\<Meters\>\""}]}], "}"}]}], 
     "}"}]}], ";"}]],ExpressionUUID->"62f64148-5ce8-4316-94bf-26224a788d71"],
 "\n\nwhere each element in the list consists of a pair of quantity/unit \
values.  \n\nThe quantities are the those of the hypothesized relationship, \
and the units can be given in any units desired, provided that Mathematica \
knows what the units are.   The names of these units must be supplied in the \
correct form.  The units can be combined, as above, using any power-law \
function of other units.  I like to use all SI MKS units for my inputs as \
otherwise I get confused.  Note that the units inputted are really proxies \
for the dimensions of a quantity, expressed in terms of the 7 fundamental \
base dimensions:  \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]TimeUnit\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote],  \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]LengthUnit\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]MassUnit\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]ElectricCurrentUnit\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]TemperatureUnit\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]AmountUnit\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]LuminousIntensityUnit\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], whose \
SI units are \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Seconds\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], \
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]Meters\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], \
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]Kilograms\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], \
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]Amperes\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], \
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]Kelvins\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], \
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]Moles\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote],and \
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]Candelas\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], respectively.\n\n\
With this single input, BuckPi will return a number of different options that \
represent valid non-dimensional expressions.  The reason there are multiple \
outputs is that the non-dimensional groups are not themselves unique, just \
the ",
 StyleBox["number of independent",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " groups.  We will cover the second optional arguments later in the \
examples.\n"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9374112342771807`*^9, 3.937411328412737*^9}, {
   3.937411381951689*^9, 3.9374116316207867`*^9}, {3.937411690188115*^9, 
   3.93741193008556*^9}, {3.9374138011785517`*^9, 3.937413814487268*^9}, 
   3.937414712783978*^9},ExpressionUUID->"c5bf6675-9a08-44ef-a4be-\
d736257e142a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"BuckPi", "[", 
     RowBox[{"varlist_", ",", 
      RowBox[{"nonrep_", " ", ":", 
       RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"pretty_", "  ", ":", " ", "True"}]}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
       "bp", ",", "varnames", ",", "funddim", ",", "q", ",", "getpow", ",", 
        "m1", ",", "m2", ",", "varunits", ",", "allvars", ",", "ngroups", ",",
         "userwants", ",", "cases", ",", "checkdet", ",", "allgroups", ",", 
        "usergets", ",", "pows", ",", "ex", ",", "out"}], "}"}], ",", 
      "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"varnames", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"varlist", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", 
          RowBox[{"All", ",", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"varunits", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"varlist", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", 
          RowBox[{"All", ",", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"funddim", " ", "=", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"UnitDimensions", "[", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{
             "\"\<Seconds\>\"", ",", "\"\<Meters\>\"", ",", 
              "\"\<Kilograms\>\"", ",", "\"\<Amperes\>\"", ",", 
              "\"\<Kelvins\>\"", ",", "\"\<Moles\>\"", ",", 
              "\"\<Candelas\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", "1"}], "]"}], "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", 
          RowBox[{"All", ",", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"q", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"UnitDimensions", "[", "varunits", "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"getpow", "[", "lis_", "]"}], " ", ":=", "   ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Table", "[", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Pick", "[", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"lis", "[", 
              RowBox[{"[", 
               RowBox[{"All", ",", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"StringEndsQ", "[", " ", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"lis", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", 
                 RowBox[{"All", ",", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
               RowBox[{"funddim", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "j", "]"}], "]"}]}], " ", "]"}]}], " ", "]"}], 
           ",", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"j", ",", "1", ",", 
             RowBox[{"Length", "[", "funddim", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], " ", "/.",
          "  ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", "}"}], " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", "0", "}"}]}]}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"m1", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
         RowBox[{"getpow", ",", "q"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"m2", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"m1", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", 
          RowBox[{"All", ",", "All", ",", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"bp", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", " ", 
         RowBox[{"NullSpace", "[", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", "m2", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"allvars", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Table", "[", " ", 
         RowBox[{"j", ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"j", ",", "1", ",", 
            RowBox[{"Length", "[", "varunits", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"ngroups", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Dimensions", "[", "bp", "]"}], "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"allgroups", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Subsets", "[", 
         RowBox[{"allvars", ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", "ngroups", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"userwants", " ", "=", 
        RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Append", "[", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Table", "[", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"nonrep", "[", 
              RowBox[{"[", "j", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"j", ",", "1", ",", 
               RowBox[{"Min", "[", " ", 
                RowBox[{"ngroups", ",", 
                 RowBox[{"Length", "[", "nonrep", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], 
            "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Table", "[", " ", 
            RowBox[{"_Integer", ",", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"j", ",", "1", ",", 
               RowBox[{"ngroups", "-", 
                RowBox[{"Length", "[", "nonrep", "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], 
          "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
        RowBox[{"usergets", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Position", "[", "  ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Subset", "[", 
            RowBox[{"allvars", ",", 
             RowBox[{"{", "ngroups", "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", "userwants"}], 
          "]"}]}], "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", " ", 
       RowBox[{"cases", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"allgroups", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", 
          RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Position", "[", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Subsets", "[", 
              RowBox[{"allvars", ",", 
               RowBox[{"{", "ngroups", "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
             "userwants"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"checkdet", " ", "=", "  ", 
        RowBox[{"Table", "[", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"If", "[", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Det", "[", "  ", 
              RowBox[{"bp", "[", 
               RowBox[{"[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"cases", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"[", "j", "]"}], "]"}], ",", "All"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
              "]"}], "==", "0"}], ",", "0", ",", "1"}], "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"j", ",", "1", ",", 
            RowBox[{"Length", "[", "cases", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"usergets", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Pick", "[", " ", 
         RowBox[{"cases", ",", " ", "checkdet", ",", "1"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"pows", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Table", "[", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"bp", " ", ".", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Inverse", "[", " ", 
            RowBox[{"bp", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"usergets", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "j", "]"}], "]"}], ",", "All"}], "]"}], "]"}], 
            "]"}]}], " ", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"j", ",", "1", ",", 
            RowBox[{"Length", "[", "usergets", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"ex", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Table", "[", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Table", "[", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Product", "[", " ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"varnames", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "ivar", "]"}], "]"}], "^", 
               RowBox[{"pows", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", 
                 RowBox[{"j", ",", "ivar", ",", "igrp"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"ivar", ",", "1", ",", 
                RowBox[{"Length", "[", "varlist", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], 
            ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"igrp", ",", "1", ",", "ngroups"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
          
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"j", ",", "1", ",", 
            RowBox[{"Length", "[", "usergets", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"out", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"If", "[", 
         RowBox[{"pretty", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"TableForm", "[", " ", 
           RowBox[{"ex", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"TableHeadings", " ", "->", " ", 
             RowBox[{"{", " ", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
                RowBox[{"j", ",", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"j", ",", "1", ",", 
                   RowBox[{"Length", "[", "usergets", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}],
                ",", " ", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
               RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"\[CapitalPi]", "[", "j", "]"}], ",", 
                 RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"j", ",", "1", ",", "ngroups"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], 
              " ", "}"}]}]}], "]"}], ",", "ex"}], "]"}]}]}]}], 
     "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  "\[IndentingNewLine]"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.937403399452818*^9, 3.9374034284862947`*^9}, {
   3.93740347674547*^9, 3.9374034774362307`*^9}, {3.937403558357596*^9, 
   3.93740358055477*^9}, {3.937403616699394*^9, 3.937403638227325*^9}, {
   3.937403681774581*^9, 3.937403692758662*^9}, {3.93740375788279*^9, 
   3.937403772400264*^9}, 3.937403812243733*^9, {3.9374038596941357`*^9, 
   3.9374039484509497`*^9}, {3.937403979082367*^9, 3.937404018358885*^9}, {
   3.937404056998949*^9, 3.937404119431725*^9}, {3.937404152890505*^9, 
   3.937404256223981*^9}, {3.937404291699545*^9, 3.937404294260995*^9}, {
   3.937404430250059*^9, 3.937404483533998*^9}, {3.9374046382553167`*^9, 
   3.937404835884425*^9}, {3.937404924380768*^9, 3.9374049725656843`*^9}, {
   3.937405027972508*^9, 3.937405030165481*^9}, {3.93740563106417*^9, 
   3.9374056941556873`*^9}, {3.937405978343256*^9, 3.937406042798686*^9}, {
   3.93740681237523*^9, 3.937406814826202*^9}, {3.937406847743425*^9, 
   3.937406900004485*^9}, {3.937407140773855*^9, 3.9374071733340178`*^9}, {
   3.937407230328396*^9, 3.937407341651403*^9}, {3.937407722748705*^9, 
   3.9374077659022818`*^9}, {3.9374078268659973`*^9, 
   3.9374078629930763`*^9}, {3.937407900096178*^9, 3.93740790321128*^9}, {
   3.937407964427355*^9, 3.937408021308375*^9}, {3.937408059694556*^9, 
   3.937408093616518*^9}, 3.937408139076721*^9, {3.937408205364806*^9, 
   3.937408240614249*^9}, {3.9374086857572803`*^9, 3.937408689710169*^9}, {
   3.937409495865041*^9, 3.937409511119573*^9}, {3.9374096868489227`*^9, 
   3.937409712531722*^9}, {3.937409883420775*^9, 3.937409886313757*^9}, {
   3.937410022308017*^9, 3.9374100233420887`*^9}, {3.9374101101485662`*^9, 
   3.93741011251051*^9}, {3.937410148218835*^9, 3.9374103117073402`*^9}, {
   3.937410374791114*^9, 3.937410395366147*^9}, {3.9374105276237707`*^9, 
   3.937410528514742*^9}, 3.937410587002205*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[2]:=",ExpressionUUID->"3205ab66-a86c-4290-8f9e-d24640ff3744"]
}, Open  ]],

